1
00:00:00,233 --> 00:00:01,433
Before you confirm,

2
00:00:01,433 --> 00:00:03,633
your app shows a new monthly amount,

3
00:00:03,633 --> 00:00:06,200
not the plan you already made.

4
00:00:06,667 --> 00:00:08,900
Skip Check, by FinLit Ventures,

5
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:11,033
does not change the SIP.

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:12,867
Twelve thousand rupees,

7
00:00:12,867 --> 00:00:15,200
reduced to six thousand for six months,

8
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:19,900
is thirty-six thousand rupees of contributions that would not be invested.

9
00:00:20,367 --> 00:00:22,400
If you state a contribution target,

10
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:25,767
that gap is six months of planned contributions.

11
00:00:26,067 --> 00:00:29,567
Not wealth, not a return, and not units.

12
00:00:30,033 --> 00:00:32,500
A full pause of twelve thousand for six months

13
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:36,200
is seventy-two thousand rupees, labeled separately.

14
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:39,100
A pause stops the contribution.

15
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:41,200
A reduction does not.

16
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:44,867
The restart month stays on the decision card.

17
00:00:44,867 --> 00:00:47,667
Skip Check will not restart the SIP.

18
00:00:48,133 --> 00:00:50,800
Keep, reduce, or pause.

19
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:54,167
A cash need can make a pause legitimate.

20
00:00:54,167 --> 00:00:56,900
Existing units stay invested.

21
00:00:57,367 --> 00:00:59,767
Take the decision card with you.

22
00:00:59,767 --> 00:01:04,000
Decision support. Not investment advice.
